OL,3,GNEWSAInquest date set for boy found
OL,4,Awith dead father
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest into the death of a toddler
OL,7,Fwho was discovered with his dead father
OL,8,Fis set to start in February next year.
OL,10,FTwo-year-old Bronson Battersby and his
OL,11,Ffather, Kenneth Battersby, 60, were
OL,12,Ffound at a property in Skegness on 9
OL,13,FJanuary 2024.
OL,15,FA fifth pre-inquest review at the Myle
OL,16,FCross Centre in Lincoln heard a
OL,17,Ffour-week jury inquest was scheduled to
OL,18,Fbegin on 22 February 2027.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
