OL,3,GNEWSAInquest date set for boy found
OL,4,Awith dead father
OL,5,
OL,6,FJayne Wilkes, area coroner for Greater
OL,7,FLincolnshire, also requested that any
OL,8,Foutstanding evidence be submitted by 23
OL,9,FOctober, with a final witness list by
OL,10,F27 November.
